exercises.task:
Java:
void setAge(int age) {
  if (age < 0) {
    throw new IllegalArgumentException("age must be >= 0");
  }
}
try {
  setAge(-5);
} catch (IllegalArgumentException e) {
  System.out.println(e.getMessage()); // age must be >= 0
}

Throw and catch the same error in JavaScript, printing the message.

